<classification_task>
The conversation history is provided above as prior messages.
The current user question is in the final Human message.
Select the most appropriate pipeline_type and fill in all required parameters.
Be conservative: when in doubt between simple and standard, choose standard.
Be very precise about complex: only use it for genuinely multi-faceted or causal questions.
</classification_task>
